      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那么我郑重宣布！　莱茵力量的胜利庆祝会，现在开始！\n……干杯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d073267650ed7e863c0f0318b55b300abe9d17260231d508d67ecb9d4cf904f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
