      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『我以自己的方式去奔跑』。……在樱花赏上，我认为\n自己做到了最好。你也作为训练员，给予了我正确的指导。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b572ed39224ed770578b2ce6939bdb8d175e1c485566fd166764e4838857705",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
