    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c992026bd8480e149f16e5d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我差点又想道歉，赶紧闭上了嘴。西沙里奥露出了\n满意的微笑，她仰望着星空――然后突然间，开口了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05410b87ec858ccb48a97a0df9ecd83ee341c45ed818598c64b005b579ec1abb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
